OL,3,GNEWSAPool replacement plans paused
OL,4,Aafter opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to replace a pool at a leisure
OL,7,Fcentre have been paused following
OL,8,Fopposition from residents.
OL,10,FThe #1.65m proposals for The Quays
OL,11,FSwimming and Diving Complex in
OL,12,FSouthampton would have seen the Lagoon
OL,13,FPool replaced with an "active play
OL,14,Fzone".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
