PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F336A1790141193
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPool replacement plans paused
OL,4,Aafter opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouthampton City Council's cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for leisure, Toqeer Kataria,
OL,8,Ftold a cabinet meeting the plans had
OL,9,Fbeen withdrawn from the agenda after
OL,10,Ffeedback from users and a
OL,11,Frecommendation from the council's
OL,12,Foverview and scrutiny management
OL,13,Fcommittee.
OL,15,FHe said the authority would now engage
OL,16,Fwith users, families and relevant
OL,17,Forganisations before bringing any
OL,18,Fproposals back.
